# Supabase local state
#
# Migrations are NOT ignored. They were, on the reasoning that schema and RLS
# internals should stay out of the repo, and the cost of that was concrete:
# 24 migration files existed only on one machine, the core tables had no
# committed DDL at all, and nobody could tell which indexes or policies were
# actually live. `supabase db pull` output would have been ignored too.
#
# This repo is private. Schema belongs in it.
/supabase/.temp/

# Test/debug artifacts
/.playwright-mcp/
.unlazy/

# Auto-generated by next.config agentRules
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# unlazy verification scratch (regenerated per run)
.unlazy-render/
.unlazy-lint-baseline/
.unlazy-baseline
